 "_comment": [
  "SPEC-LOC-002 §3.5: the ONE list of languages. Adding a language = one row here + an i18n/<code>/ folder (INV-1).",
  "cardinal/ordinal: CLDR plural rule strings copied verbatim (samples included) from CLDR release 48, common/supplemental/plurals.xml and ordinals.xml.",
  "pt-PT has no ordinal row in CLDR ordinals.xml; it inherits pt's (CLDR parent locale), copied here so every row is self-contained.",
  "endonym: the menu name; Settings choice label = endonym, plus ' (english_name)' when the two differ.",
  "fonts: font families that must cover the script (zh relies on system CJK fonts today; no bundled family yet).",
  "status: terms_only | partial | complete. dev_only rows (qps pseudo-locale) are never offered to users.",
  "pseudo: true makes the catalog render every text through core/i18n/pseudo.py (the qps developer tool, §4.9).",
  "qt_qm_fallback (optional): Qt locales whose qtbase .qm file is loaded when Qt ships none for qt_locale (pt_PT -> pt_BR). Formatting stays qt_locale; QLocale.setDefault is never called (§4.3, OD-7)."
 ],
